SUMMARY:Soul Nite with Royal Rohn
DESCRIPTION:Royal Rohn from Charlotte NC brings Southern Soul and R&B to The Double Crown Friday July 10th!!!\n\n10 PM $10\n\n\nThe Double Crown – Great vibes\, great bourbon\, and great music! (21+ only\, dog friendly) A West Asheville institution\, the Double Crown hosts Western Wednesdays\, karaoke\, DJ’s and rousing Gospel & Soul night’s each month. It’s a great place for an intimate evening of dancing\, drinks and fun\, especially if you love a good dive bar.
