SUMMARY:"Nearby & Notable" | Bluegrass Jam
DESCRIPTION:Calling all pickers! We are hosting an open bluegrass jams for local musicians to gather and play every Saturday from 1-4pm. House smoked BBQ and beer brewed on site available for purchase\, and there’s plenty of room for families to play and explore.\nCome out to listen or join in!\n\n\nUnfamiliar with Watershed? Our 117 acre Bike park\, brewery\, and BBQ join is part of the Foothills Farm & Butchery family businesses (Butcher Shop\, Grange\, and Hell or High Water in Black Mountain\, NC) and is built for full days out with the whole crew. Ride backcountry trails or the pump track\, wade in the Catawba River or float in our natural pond\, then settle into a cold craft Butcher Babe beer and smoked BBQ without ever moving the car. Bring the kids\, bring the group\, bring whoever needs a good day outside.\n\nBike park\, brewery & family riverside hangout\, just downstream from Catawba Falls and 2 minutes to downtown Old Fort. foothillslocalmeats.com/watershed-bike-park \n 
URL:https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/nearby-notable-bluegrass-jam/2026-07-11/
LOCATION:Foothills Watershed Old Fort\, 655 Catawba River Rd\, Old Fort\, NC\, 28762
CATEGORIES:Asheville Area,Live Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://livemusicasheville.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/733139710_122317382222208520_3959165715264053262_n-e1783717220137.jpg
GEO:35.6214871;-82.192543
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=Foothills Watershed Old Fort 655 Catawba River Rd Old Fort NC 28762;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=655 Catawba River Rd:geo:-82.192543,35.6214871
END:VEVENT
